# Per-tile fetch buffer. Byte-for-byte duplicates of the merged `<region>-ways.json`
# next door, kept only so a 504 on the last tile of a 3x3 does not discard eight good
# pulls. `probe.py` short-circuits on the merged file, so a fresh clone reproduces every
# number without these and without re-querying Overpass.
raw/tiles/
